{"start":"t:head","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en"}}
{"text":"Prayer while the Scrolls of the Torah are taken out of the Ark"}
{"end":"t:head"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"instruction","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en"}}
{"text":"The Holy Ark is opened and, while the reader takes out two Torah scrolls, the congregation says:"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/10/35","n":"35"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"It was when the Holy Ark set out that Moses said: Arise, O Lord, that Thine enemies may be scattered and that those who hate Thee, may flee from Thy countenance. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/torah/vayehi_binsoa/ki_mitziyyon"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"2","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/torah/vayehi_binsoa/quotations/ki_mitziyyon"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"3","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/torah/vayehi_binsoa/quotations/ki_mitziyyon/3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"half-verse","n":"b","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/torah/vayehi_binsoa/quotations/ki_mitziyyon/3/b"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:isaiah/2/3/b"}}
{"text":" From Zion does Torah go forth and the word of the Lord from Jerusalem."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"half-verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
